# The headless desktop the captures are of: one output, a flat dark
# background, no bar, no borders or gaps that would be the compositor's and
# not an application's. Its size and scale are set per run by vp9-sink's
# SetDesktopSize and `swaymsg output`.
output HEADLESS-1 bg #2e3440 solid_color
default_border none
default_floating_border none
font pango:DejaVu Sans 10
focus_follows_mouse no
seat * hide_cursor 0
xwayland disable
